; === Zyl Standard Library — Math/Crypto Parent Module ===
; Module: math
; Provides: re-export of every math submodule
;
; `(use math/math)` pulls in the whole tree. Module resolution inlines
; each dependency exactly once (module_resolver.zyl's seen-list), so
; importing both this module and one of its submodules directly is
; harmless -- though importing only what a program uses keeps its
; compile time and binary size down, and the crypto tree is large.
;
; Layout:
;   math/bits                             word and bit primitives
;   math/words                            flat arena-backed Int arrays
;   math/secret/secret                    constant-time compare, erasure
;   math/bignum/bignum                    fixed-width naturals
;   math/bignum/montgomery                Montgomery arithmetic, modexp
;   math/bignum/barrett                   reduction by a fixed modulus
;   math/bignum/modular                   modular add/sub/inverse, primality
;   math/rand/rand                        generator helpers
;   math/rand/crypto                      system entropy (getrandom)
;   math/rand/deterministic               ChaCha20 seeded generator
;   math/hash/sha2                        SHA-256
;   math/hash/sha512                      SHA-512
;   math/hash/sha3                        SHA3-256/512, SHAKE128/256
;   math/hash/blake2b                     BLAKE2b
;   math/hash/blake3                      BLAKE3
;   math/hash/hmac                        HMAC-SHA256
;   math/crypto/symmetric/chacha20        ChaCha20
;   math/crypto/symmetric/poly1305        Poly1305
;   math/crypto/symmetric/chacha20poly    ChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD
;   math/crypto/symmetric/aesgcm          AES-GCM (AES-NI only)
;   math/crypto/asymmetric/x25519         X25519
;   math/crypto/asymmetric/ed25519        Ed25519
;   math/crypto/asymmetric/ecdsa          ECDSA (P-256, secp256k1, P-384)
;   math/crypto/asymmetric/rsa            RSA-PSS and RSA-OAEP
;   math/crypto/kdf/hkdf                  HKDF-SHA256
;   math/crypto/kdf/pbkdf2                PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256
;   math/crypto/kdf/argon2                Argon2id

(use math/bits)
(use math/words)
(use math/secret/secret)
(use math/bignum/bignum)
(use math/bignum/montgomery)
(use math/bignum/barrett)
(use math/bignum/modular)
(use math/rand/rand)
(use math/rand/crypto)
(use math/rand/deterministic)
(use math/hash/sha2)
(use math/hash/sha512)
(use math/hash/sha3)
(use math/hash/blake2b)
(use math/hash/blake3)
(use math/hash/hmac)
(use math/crypto/symmetric/chacha20)
(use math/crypto/symmetric/poly1305)
(use math/crypto/symmetric/chacha20poly)
(use math/crypto/symmetric/aesgcm)
(use math/crypto/asymmetric/x25519)
(use math/crypto/asymmetric/ed25519)
(use math/crypto/asymmetric/ecdsa)
(use math/crypto/asymmetric/rsa)
(use math/crypto/kdf/hkdf)
(use math/crypto/kdf/pbkdf2)
(use math/crypto/kdf/argon2)
